 for a conquering force to invade and take over. And it is exactly why it was forbidden eons ago by the legendary warrior Leda who saw this coming.\n\nThis Leda warrior's duty now falls to Yohko and some newfound friends to stop the onslaught and return the 2 worlds in balance.\n\nMaybe Yohko is not so ordinary after all.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Lost Civilization","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":44,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Robot","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shrine Maiden","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Desert","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":30,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Leda: The Fantastic Adventure of Yohko","english":"Leda: The Fantastic Adventure of Yohko","native":"幻夢戦記レダ","romaji":"Genmu Senki Leda","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"幻梦战记莉达"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"幻梦战记蕾达"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Fantastic Adventure Of Yohko: Leda"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}